  "body": "## What changed\n- Added the example catalog layout under `examples/catalog/<family>/<case>/` and documented it in `examples/catalog/README.md`.\n- Seeded `examples/catalog/2d/first-part/` from `examples/first-part`, carrying `model/gen_first_part_obj.py`, `model/first-part.obj`, `build.camscript`, `first-part.camproj`, `first-part.nc`, and `README.md`.\n- Added `cam.call(tool, args?)` in `crates/app/src/script/call.rs`, registered it in `crates/app/src/script/mod.rs` and `assets/scripts/cam.d.ts`, and exported `crate::mcp::call`.\n- Accepted `.camscript` files alongside `.js` in `crates/app/src/cli.rs`.\n- Added `cargo xtask catalog` (`xtask/src/catalog.rs`, `catalog_media.rs`, `catalog_pdf.rs`) to rebuild or `--check` cases via `camcraft-cli`, render off-screen screenshots onto an images-only branch (`catalog-screenshots` by default, with `--with-guide` hooking into #1902's `guide_images` renderer), and build optional per-case PDFs.\n- Wired `examples/catalog/` diffs to `app:example_catalog` via `xtask/src/catalog.rs::map_catalog` and `xtask/src/quick.rs`.\n- Added regression suites in `crates/app/tests/example_catalog.rs`, `crates/ui/tests/catalog_render.rs`, `xtask/tests/catalog.rs`, and `xtask/src/catalog_tests.rs`.\n- Recorded architectural choices in `docs/decisions/2393-catalog-infra.md`.\n\n## Cause\nThe repository had no shared layout, headless build script bridge, or automated regenerate-verify-post regression frame for catalog examples. Legacy `examples/first-part` used hand-saved project and NC files instead of an undoable script.\n\n## Tests\n- **Pinning tests (red before fix, green after fix):**\n  - `cli::script_lane_accepts_camscript_extension` failed with exit code 2 (`not a .js job`) before the fix and passed after.\n  - `scripting::cam_call_builds_headlessly_and_records_caught_refusals` failed with `TypeError: not a callable function` before the fix and passed after.\n  - `example_catalog::every_catalog_case_opens_regenerates_verifies_and_posts_byte_for_byte` and `example_catalog::every_catalog_case_rebuilds_from_camscript` failed because `examples/catalog` did not exist before the fix and passed after.\n  - `catalog_render::catalog_cases_open_and_frame_cleanly` failed because no catalog projects existed before the fix and passed after.\n  - `xtask` CLI tests (`xtask/tests/catalog.rs`: `help_lists_catalog_command`, `catalog_check_verifies_seed_case`, `catalog_refuses_unsafe_branch_and_in_tree_output_and_bad_flags`) failed with `unknown task 'catalog'` before the fix and passed after.\n- **Mutation checks:**\n  - Reverted `crates/app/src/cli.rs` to `upstream/main`: `script_lane_accepts_camscript_extension` failed; restored: passed.\n  - Reverted `crates/app/src/script/mod.rs` to `upstream/main`: `cam_call_builds_headlessly_and_records_caught_refusals` failed; restored: passed.\n  - Mutated `examples/catalog/2d/first-part/first-part.nc` (`G21` -> `G20`): both `example_catalog` tests failed; restored: passed.\n  - Removed the `main`/`master`/`HEAD` guard in `xtask/src/catalog_media.rs` and `map_catalog` selection in `xtask/src/catalog.rs`: `catalog_tests` failed on both; restored: passed.\n- **Gates and checks:**\n  - `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 109/109 steps passed (`app` unit + 105 `app` suites, `ui::catalog_render`, `xtask` unit + integration tests).\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed with 0 warnings.\n  - `cargo xtask catalog --screenshots --with-guide --screenshots-branch test-catalog-screenshots`: rendered 14 PNGs (`catalog/2d/first-part/first-part.png` and 13 `guide/*.png`) onto an orphan branch without touching the working tree (temporary branch deleted after check).\n\n## Goldens moved\n- None modified. Added the new catalog case output `examples/catalog/2d/first-part/first-part.nc` (369 lines), generated by `build.camscript` on `upstream/main` (`abe24ff09`).\n\n## Not exercised\n- Live `cargo xtask catalog --pdf` execution against `pandoc` and headless Chrome (neither binary is installed in this environment; verified `catalog --pdf` refuses cleanly naming `pandoc`, and pinned command builders in `xtask::catalog_tests`).\n- Full `gate batch` and `gate release` tiers (only `gate quick --base upstream/main` ran).\n\n## Overlaps\n- `assets/scripts/cam.d.ts`: touches the same file as #2134 and #2310 (different lines; whichever merges second refreshes).\n- `crates/app/src/mcp/mod.rs`: touches the same file as #2134 and #2149 (different lines; whichever merges second refreshes).\n- `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs`: touches the same file as #2092, #2134, and #2149 (different lines/functions; whichever merges second refreshes).\n- `crates/app/src/script/mod.rs`: touches the same file as #2134 and #2310 (different lines; whichever merges second refreshes).\n\nChangelog: Add example catalog infrastructure (`examples/catalog/`, `cam.call`, `.camscript`, `cargo xtask catalog`) seeded with `2d/first-part`\nProcess change: yes\nFixes #2393\n",
